id: pm-context-qu0a
title: Alert on daily release failure and require merge drivers in CI
description: "Release failure alerting uses one checked-in fail-closed script: a successful empty lookup may create the stable release-failure issue, an existing issue receives a comment, and a failed lookup skips mutation to prevent duplicates. The workflow checks out the script with pinned actions/checkout v7 and no persisted credentials under contents:read plus issues:write. CI separately installs pm merge drivers before requiring them in strict health."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-22T19:02:21.960Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-24T15:33:07.677Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-24T15:33:07.628Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-24T15:33:07.628Z"
claim_principal: ox-alpha
author: ox-alpha
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: The workflow executes a tracked script checked out with a commit-pinned action and persist-credentials disabled; A successful empty lookup creates one stable release-failure issue and an existing issue receives a comment; A failed lookup performs no issue mutation and exits zero with a warning; The full package gate passes on exact-pinned pm CLI and SDK 2026.8.24 with exact configured coverage
risk: low
confidence: 100
resolution: "Replaced the inline alert with a checked-in script that refuses to mutate when the dedup lookup fails, and wired a pinned credential-free checkout."
expected_result: "Daily release failures create or update one tracking issue without duplicates, while alert API failures never mask the release failure."
actual_result: Five focused alert tests and the 222-test package gate pass on pm CLI and SDK 2026.8.24 at exact configured coverage.
notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-22T19:02:33.172Z",ox-alpha,"Gate proof: removed all five merge.pm-* config sections, ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers exited 1; after ./node_modules/.bin/pm merge install it exited 0. Plain --strict-exit stays 0 both ways."
  "2026-08-24T15:25:44.790Z","harness:codex",Cross-package review of merged pm-brief PR 79 proved the original inline implementation swallowed gh issue list failures with || true. The alert now executes a tracked script that distinguishes lookup failure from an empty result and exits 0 without mutating on uncertainty; five focused tests pass.
  "2026-08-24T15:33:06.611Z","harness:codex","Final local gate on pm CLI and SDK 2026.8.24: 222 tests passed; four configured source files measured exact 100.00 lines,100.00 branches,and 100.00 functions; 22 declarations documented; production audit found zero vulnerabilities; pack contained 13 files; changelog was regenerated. ShellCheck was unavailable on this host and is not claimed."
